In short, this means you ARE free to:
  - View, read and share this data, in its original, unmodified form
  - Link to it, cite it, or reference individual entries

...as long as you:
  - Give appropriate credit to "Event Horizon"
    (https://bbmane.github.io/event-horizon/) as the source

But you are NOT permitted to, without prior written permission:
  - Use this data for commercial purposes
  - Redistribute a modified, remixed, or re-formatted version of
