    or API, even if some entries are added or changed)

This license covers the DATA only. The code used to collect, merge
and display this data (found elsewhere in this repository) is
separately licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License
v3.0 (AGPLv3) — see /LICENSE in the repository root.

To request permission for uses outside this license, please open
